<title>SOUTH KOREA: S. Korea's Nov M2 money supply up 18.2 pct on yr.</title>
<headline>S. Korea's Nov M2 money supply up 18.2 pct on yr.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's M2 money supply rose a year-on-year 18.2 percent in November against a 13.1 percent rise a year earlier, provisional Bank of Korea figures showed on Thursday.</p>
</text>
